Package: whelk
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, guile-3.0, wtype, cava
Description: Wayland shell configured in GNU Guile Scheme
 Whelk is a Wayland shell built with a Rust core, GTK4 and gtk4-layer-shell.
 Its status bars, launcher, notification daemon and network panel are described
 in GNU Guile Scheme: a bar is a list of modules, and every module is a reading
 plus the mouse actions on it.
